<parameterdescription>
<para>The following conditions can result in this error:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>The library has not been previously initialized by <computeroutput><ref refid="group__initialization_1ga2de150803fc2f7dc6101d5af7e921dd9" kindref="member">psa_crypto_init()</ref></computeroutput>.</para></listitem><listitem><para>The operation state is not valid: it must be inactive. </para></listitem></itemizedlist>
